{"en": "239632402", "title": "Installer OpenELIS Global", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "success"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dernier test le 9 octobre 2026", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " sur Ubuntu Server 24.04 LTS : installation en ligne (version de développement), installation hors ligne de la version 3.2.2.0 et mise à niveau hors ligne vers la 3.2.3.0 sans internet, première connexion, certificat Let's Encrypt et son renouvellement, redémarrage, sauvegarde et restauration, et mise à niveau en ligne."}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Guide pratique · Informaticiens de laboratoire et administrateurs système", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ces pages expliquent comment installer OpenELIS Global 3.x sur un seul serveur Ubuntu avec Docker Compose. Elles s'adressent à la personne qui installe et entretient le serveur du laboratoire. Vous n'avez pas besoin de connaître Docker : chaque étape donne les commandes exactes et ce que vous devez voir."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Installer en quatre étapes"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Préparer le serveur", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1711472648"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : installer Ubuntu Server et Docker."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Obtenir OpenELIS, au choix :"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Installation en ligne", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1712160806"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : le serveur télécharge lui-même OpenELIS."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Installation hors ligne", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1711636518"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : préparez un paquet sur un autre ordinateur et copiez-le sur le serveur."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Configurer et démarrer OpenELIS", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1711407126"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : mots de passe, fuseau horaire et réseau, premier démarrage, première connexion."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Mettre en place un certificat HTTPS", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1712029723"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (facultatif) : votre propre certificat, ou un certificat gratuit de Let's Encrypt."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Entretenir le serveur"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sauvegarder et restaurer OpenELIS Global", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1711669276"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Mettre à niveau ou désinstaller OpenELIS Global", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1711931398"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dépanner une installation d'OpenELIS Global", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1712128011"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Choisir le mode d'installation"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Installation en ligne", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Installation hors ligne", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "À utiliser quand"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le serveur dispose d'une connexion internet fiable"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le serveur a une connexion internet lente, limitée ou inexistante"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ce que vous obtenez"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La version de "}, {"type": "text", "text": "développement", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " actuelle (images "}, {"type": "text", "text": "develop", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La "}, {"type": "text", "text": "dernière version", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", par exemple 3.2.3.0"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Mode de téléchargement"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le serveur télécharge environ 2 Go d'images depuis Docker Hub"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Vous préparez un paquet (1,5 à 2 Go) sur un ordinateur connecté à internet et vous le copiez sur le serveur"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Internet nécessaire sur le serveur"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Oui"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Uniquement pour installer Docker, sauf si Docker est déjà installé"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les installations en ligne suivent le développement.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Elles exécutent la dernière version "}, {"type": "text", "text": "develop", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", qui évolue à mesure que l'équipe intègre son travail. Pour un laboratoire qui traite des échantillons de patients, utilisez l'installation hors ligne de la dernière version, ou la distribution stable lorsqu'elle sera disponible."}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ce dont vous avez besoin"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Un serveur ou une machine virtuelle sous "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Ubuntu Server, dernière version LTS", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (24.04 au moment de la rédaction ; la 22.04 fonctionne aussi). Utilisez l'édition Server, pas Desktop."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Un serveur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "x86 64 bits (amd64)", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Les images OpenELIS sont construites uniquement pour x86 ; les serveurs ARM (par exemple AWS Graviton) ne sont donc pas pris en charge."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Au moins "}, {"type": "text", "text": "2 cœurs de processeur, 8 Go de mémoire et 40 Go de disque", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". 4 cœurs sont préférables pour un laboratoire très actif."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Un compte utilisateur autorisé à exécuter "}, {"type": "text", "text": "sudo", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le fuseau horaire dans lequel travaille le laboratoire, par exemple "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Africa/Abidjan", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ou "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Pacific/Port_Moresby", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Liste des noms de fuseaux horaires", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_tz_database_time_zones"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Un endroit sûr pour conserver les mots de passe, comme le gestionnaire de mots de passe du site."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ports réseau"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Port"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Utilisé pour"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ouvert sur le réseau du laboratoire ?"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "443", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "OpenELIS dans le navigateur (HTTPS)"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Oui", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "80", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Redirige vers 443"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Oui"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "22", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "SSH pour les administrateurs"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Uniquement depuis les ordinateurs d'administration"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "15432", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Base de données"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "8080, 8443", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Serveur d'application OpenELIS, accès direct"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "8081, 8444", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Serveur FHIR, accès direct"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non, sauf si un autre système doit accéder directement à FHIR"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "warning"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Docker contourne le pare-feu d'Ubuntu (ufw)", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " pour tous les ports qu'il publie. Bloquer le port 15432 dans ufw ne protège pas la base de données. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Configurer et démarrer OpenELIS", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1711407126/Configure+and+start+OpenELIS+Global#Keep-internal-ports-off-the-network"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " explique comment garder ces ports hors du réseau."}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ancien paquet d'installation"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les versions précédentes de cette page utilisaient un paquet d'installation avec "}, {"type": "text", "text": "setup_OpenELIS.py", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", publié pour la dernière fois pour la 3.2.0.1. Il n'est plus maintenu et ces pages ne le couvrent pas. Si votre serveur a été installé avec ce paquet, contactez l'équipe OpenELIS avant toute mise à niveau."}]}], "version": 1}}